"Limestone Shelf"
"The Elhanni to the south drops a majestic fifty feet to the rocks below,

spraying a fine mist into the air.  The mist coats this limestone shelf,

making it very slick.  The shelf continues to the east, upstream, and follows

a descent west along the granite rock of the mountain to the north.

