#4015
"Pebbly Mountain Trail - North of a Rope Bridge"
"A small pebbled trail winds its way east-west along the mountain face to

the west.  To the south, a narrow rope bridge extends across widening

river rapids.  The bridge looks quite flimsy and sways dangerously from

east to west.  The pebbled trail crumbles slowly, pulled by gravity down

its steep gradient to the west.

