#4016
"Pebbly Mountain Trail - Along a Gorge"
"This faint trail is dotted by shrubs and mountain grasses, but most

vegetation would find the rocky ground inhospitable.  The trail overlooks

a gorge to the south, through which a rushing river flows west toward the

crashing sound of a waterfall.  A pebbled trail lies to the west, while

to the east, this faint trail continues.

