#4019
"Elhanni River"
"The Elhanni flows north to south, a wide, strong current making its

journey from the mountains to the sea.  On the west bank, the muddy

ground gives way to a wide, grassy plain.  To the east, the unforgiving

stone of the Cairns marks the edge of the river.

