#4021
"Elhanni River - North of a Bridge"
"To the south, a rugged wooden bridge hangs low across the river; so low,

in fact, that the Elhanni rushes beneath it without room to accomodate

swimming.  The grassy plains to the west become a muddy bank along the

river, which continues upstream to the north.  To the east, the bank is

dry and rocky.

"
