#4027
"South End of a Rope Bridge"
"Cracked, warped, rotting boards form this rope bridge, missing boards

forming a toothy smile high above the rocky gorge below.  To the north,

the bridge overhands a rushing river, nearing the deafening sound of a

waterfall.  To the south, a faint path disappears into a dark, misty

forest.

